# Read by the Deploy to Cloudflare button (#732): each name below is a field on its page. It lists
# only what the installer must type. The deploy generates SESSION_SECRET, WEBHOOK_KEY, CRON_KEY,
# INGEST_KEY and MAIL_TOKEN_KEY on the first build; tokens from other services are entered in the
# app later. The full list of secrets, for local dev, is .dev.vars.reference.
# Never commit a value here.

# Required on the button path (#606): a phrase you make up and keep. /setup asks for it once,
# before it creates the first admin; once an admin exists it can be deleted.
SETUP_TOKEN=
